{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80622125d1e91ffcf6b57e487834246402e86e4bd90e1ae622c3f0aa7283cd1a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a:2_4_011_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddde3db9e7cc79c123060d99987d01028cfebb6e8259268da1eeb245e04b618e",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n明天按预定时间集合没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a:2_4_011_03_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9398b402448d7fb958fab95eaa3f61d8585b7a41f2700876e636bc2e0514b924",
      "text": "没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a:2_4_011_03_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72da7040b5d4a70c7b4b6e7ecf888dd1b20f68edb069b5dc5f785ac147f88368",
      "text": "太好了！电视天气预报说是晴天，\n应该能悠闲地赏花了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a:2_4_011_03_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c33d03ddfd7d67456884cafc3ac1396e7eb63b13e5425a07cfdf3c54b3ba05d",
      "text": "感觉能拍到很多漂亮的照片，很让人期待呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a:2_4_011_03_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a54de65594c3409d7a6593e8002a967d2c8b5ee11111d4f861405f999ddc0af",
      "text": "可以的话，我也想给制作人\n拍几张呢。之前跟你提过对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a:2_4_011_03_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca9b67227e337ad44baf711ed7679d0fa763a125a0b3b5b9468f32896d971f25",
      "text": "从那之后我又稍微练习了一下，\n我觉得一定能拍出好照片的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a:2_4_011_03_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ace46dc72a80b0d8075a8dacac44cc21846cdb16c4600986281d237f40b8dd1",
      "text": "很期待会拍出\n怎样的照片！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a:2_4_011_03_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd9a7afff5a720c606b13ff659eda287ea030de48c529bbe4c8ed188b1a78864",
      "text": "也请教教我\n拍摄的诀窍吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a:2_4_011_03_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccae985f6352acc087db6c60fd118f4a0bc6ff184fb391554ee8e52c9454a488",
      "text": "嗯，敬请期待吧。\n为了能让你满意，我会加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a:2_4_011_03_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48cb40ad1cbf59f6f89c7f1dd4958dfd702007f9ab9563e80b02ad62d9ccdc84",
      "text": "那也挺有意思呢！只要是我懂的范围，\n我就教给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a:2_4_011_03_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86ad330980e67a7c94ad55a0aa3d90c19d792035a781ccdbec1fc5da6c6cf3ca",
      "text": "为了能尽情享受，今天得早点睡才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_a:2_4_011_03_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b133d30b2132d547a574c13bc44eadc38f875f7652dc4e25887cf87f3f4ab12e",
      "text": "那么，明天就拜托了哦。\n晚安，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
